[3] MERGE GUARD

CONFIG (GitHub Settings):

TARGET:
refactor/v0.2

RULES:
- Require pull request before merge
- Require status checks to pass
- Require branches to be up to date
- Block direct push

RESULT:
- Prevent merge if checks not complete
- Eliminate “merge while unknown”

